  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Map Data to a Card**\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Decide what your card will represent.\r\n   *Example: one sneaker, one dessert, one pet*\r\n\r\n2. Label each part of the card with the kind of information it should show:\r\n\r\n   * image\r\n   * title\r\n   * description\r\n   * badge\r\n\r\n3. Make sure your labels match your topic.\r\n\r\n4. Save your work to your **Backpack** so you can use it in the next level.\r\n\r\n",
    "display_name": "Card View",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Label the data needed to display one item, such as an image, title, description, and badge.",
